  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "タップダンスの　たつじん。\nこおりで　できた　ステッキを　ふり\nかろやかな　ステップを　ひろうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "탭 댄스의 달인이다.\n얼음으로 만든 지팡이를 휘두르며\n경쾌한 스텝을 선보인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "踢踏舞的達人。\n會揮動手中的冰杖，\n向觀眾表演輕快的舞步。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Véritable virtuose des claquettes, il se donne\nen spectacle en dansant d’un pas léger\ntout en jonglant avec sa canne de glace.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieser begnadete Stepptänzer schwingt einen\naus Eis geformten Gehstock und gibt mit\nleichtem Fuß seinen Tanz zum Besten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es un bailarín consumado de claqué. Agita su\nbastón de hielo mientras exhibe su destreza con\ngráciles pasos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È un maestro del tip tap. Fa roteare il suo\nbastone di ghiaccio mentre si esibisce\nin leggiadri passi di danza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s highly skilled at tap-dancing. It waves its cane\nof ice in time with its graceful movements.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "タップダンスの　達人。\n氷で　できた　ステッキを　振り\n軽やかな　ステップを　披露する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "踢踏舞的达人。\n会挥动手中的冰杖，\n向观众表演轻快的舞步。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es un bailarín consumado de claqué. Agita su\nbastón de hielo mientras exhibe su destreza con\ngráciles pasos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ユーモラスな　うごきで　みんなの\nにんきもの。　おなかの　もようから\nサイコパワーを　ほうしゅつする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "유머러스한 움직임으로 모두에게\n인기가 높다. 배의 무늬에서\n사이코 파워를 방출한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "幽默的動作使牠獲得了\n眾人的喜愛。能從腹部的\n圖案釋放出精神力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses gestes hilarants le rendent très populaire.\nIl peut libérer ses pouvoirs psychiques depuis\nle motif sur son ventre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dank seiner unterhaltsamen Bewegungen ist es\nallseits sehr beliebt. Von dem Muster auf seinem\nBauch sendet es Psycho-Kräfte aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se ha granjeado la simpatía de todo el mundo\npor sus cómicos movimientos. Emite poderes\npsíquicos por el motivo de su barriga.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sue comiche movenze lo rendono simpatico\na tutti. Emette poteri psichici dal motivo che ha\nsul ventre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its amusing movements make it very popular.\nIt releases its psychic power from the pattern\non its belly.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ユーモラスな　動きで　みんなの\n人気者。　お腹の　模様から\nサイコパワーを　放出する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "幽默的动作使它获得了\n众人的喜爱。能从腹部的\n图案释放出精神力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se ha granjeado la simpatía de todo el mundo\npor sus cómicos movimientos. Emite poderes\npsíquicos por el motivo de su barriga.",
      "language": {
